msgstr "A key o' th' contraption {1}: {2}, arr!"

msgid "A left click on the ground ends the selection of the selected building and closes its panels. In the game the building stays selected."
msgstr "A left click on th' ground ends th' selection o' th' selected buildin' an' closes its panels. In th' voyage th' buildin' stays selected, arr!"

