msgstr "A robot race: nay skin scatterin' unless turned on, arr!"

msgid "A save starts paused once it has loaded, so nothing happens before you look around. In the game it runs at once."
msgstr "A stow starts paused once it has hauled, so nothin' happens afore ye spy around. In th' voyage it runs at once, arr!"

msgid "A small catchlight on the eyes instead of a mirror of the landscape."
msgstr "A small catchlight on th' eyes instead o' a mirror o' th' landscape, arr!"

msgid "A soft GPU allocation budget, not a hard reservation. Higher values keep more textures and draw distance resident; Metal uses unified memory shared with macOS and other apps."
msgstr "A soft GPU allocation budget, not a hard reservation. Higher values keep more textures an' draw distance resident; Metal uses unified memory shared wi' macOS an' other apps, arr!"

msgid "A soft sheen on the edges of cloth, a little on leather."
msgstr "A soft sheen on th' edges o' cloth, a little on leather, arr!"

msgid "A squad coming back into the area around your squads has healed for the time it was away. In the game it comes back as it left."
msgstr "A crew comin' back into th' area around yer crews has healed fer th' time it was away. In th' voyage it comes back as it left, arr!"

msgid "A swamp turtle butts and bites when it fights. In the game it fights with a sword or club drawn for it, whose moves its body cannot play, so its blows land without any motion."
msgstr "A swamp turtle butts an' bites when it fights. In th' voyage it fights wi' a sword or club drawn fer it, whose moves its body cannot play, so its blows land without any motion, arr!"

msgid "A town far from your squads is taken over or destroyed as soon as its story calls for it, so the map and the factions show it at once. In the game it changes only when you come near."
msgstr "A port far from yer crews be taken o'er or destroyed as soon as its story calls fer it, so th' chart an' th' factions show it at once. In th' voyage it changes only when ye come near, arr!"

msgid "A traced cache adds fine indirect light near the camera."
msgstr "A traced cache adds fine indirect light near th' camera, arr!"

msgid "A trader or anyone else checking your squad for an item, a race or a carried body never turns the conversation to one of your animals. In the game a pack animal carrying the item takes over the talk, so trade and the other answers do nothing."
msgstr "A trader or anyone else checkin' yer crew fer an booty, a race or a carried body ne'er turns th' conversation t' one o' yer animals. In th' voyage a pack animal carryin' th' booty takes o'er th' talk, so barter an' th' other answers do nothin', arr!"

msgid "A turret's gunner turns with the gun, facing where it aims. In the game the gunner keeps facing the turret, so once the gun swings toward a target the gunner looks off to the side."
msgstr "A turret's gunner turns wi' th' gun, facin' where it aims. In th' voyage th' gunner keeps facin' th' turret, so once th' gun swings toward a target th' gunner looks off t' th' side, arr!"

