msgid "the Ambient occlusion switch's method (it needs that switch on): Meitou's SSAO is a cheap estimate; GTAO searches each pixel's horizon, measures how much sky it really sees, and keeps the colour of the light that bounces in a corner. Costs more; off by default"
msgstr "th' Ambient occlusion switch's method (it needs that switch on): Meitou's SSAO be a cheap estimate; GTAO searches each pixel's horizon, measures how much sky it really sees, an' keeps th' colour o' th' light that bounces in a corner. Costs more; off by default"

