msgstr "Th' most deep shade by day be brightened, as a multiple o' th' voyage's exposure."

msgid "This building stands outside every outpost's build limit, so no generator can power it. Dismantle it and build it again inside the red ring."
msgstr "This buildin' stands outside every outpost's build limit, so nay generator can power it. Dismantle it an' build it again inside th' red ring."

msgid "This skill's own multiplier for your faction, in place of Squad XP. At the far left (Squad XP) it follows Squad XP."
msgstr "This skill's own multiplier fer yer faction, in place o' Squad XP. At th' far left (Squad XP) it follows Squad XP."

msgid "Turret fire is a crime"
msgstr "Turret fire be a crime"

msgid "With Blood on weapons and gear on, blood soaks into worn clothes and armour slowly, stays when the wound heals, and washes out in water and rain or fades with time. Off, the clothes show only the blood of the wound under them."
msgstr "With Blood on weapons an' gear on, blood soaks into worn clothes an' armour slowly, stays when th' wound heals, an' washes out in water an' rain or fades with time. Off, th' clothes show only th' blood o' th' wound under 'em."

msgid "built for another version of the game"
msgstr "built fer another version o' th' voyage"

msgid "follows the shade"
msgstr "follows th' shade"

msgid "its multipliers are now Squad XP in the Advanced settings (open it for each skill's own) and Show Squad XP"
msgstr "its multipliers be now Squad XP in th' Advanced settings (open it fer each skill's own) an' Show Squad XP"

msgid "its per-skill multipliers are now under Squad XP in the Advanced settings, and its XP label is Show Squad XP"
msgstr "its per-skill multipliers be now under Squad XP in th' Advanced settings, an' its XP label be Show Squad XP"

msgid "not enabled above it"
msgstr "not enabled above it"

msgid "the game draws the dust and the spray a running foot throws up as glowing sprites, as bright by night as by day and in shade as in the sun; Meitou lights them as the ground is lit: the sun through its shadows, the sky, the lamps, the same as the game's by day (docs/render-post.md \"Lit dust\")"
msgstr "th' voyage draws th' dust an' th' spray a runnin' foot throws up as glowin' sprites, as bright by night as by day an' in shade as in th' sun; Meitou lights 'em as th' ground be lit: th' sun through its shadows, th' sky, th' lamps, th' same as th' voyage's by day (docs/render-post.md \"Lit dust\")"

msgid "the game's band"
msgstr "th' voyage's band"

msgid "the game's exposure follows the picture's brightness only down to a daytime minimum, so a canyon or a street in a cliff's shadow at noon stays dark; Meitou lets it adapt by day to halfway between the game's day and night minimums (up to 1.7 times brighter in deep shade); nights, open sunny views and rooms are as before (docs/render-post.md \"Adaptive exposure\")"
msgstr "th' voyage's exposure follows th' picture's brightness only down t' a daytime minimum, so a canyon or a street in a cliff's shadow at noon stays dark; Meitou lets it adapt by day t' halfway between th' voyage's day an' night minimums (up t' 1.7 times brighter in deep shade); nights, open sunny views an' rooms be as afore (docs/render-post.md \"Adaptive exposure\")"

msgid "{1} is built into Meitou now: {2}."
msgstr "{1} be built into Meitou now: {2}."

msgid "{1} mods, {2} enabled"
msgstr "{1} mods, {2} enabled"

msgid "{1} of {2} mods shown, {3} enabled"
msgstr "{1} o' {2} mods shown, {3} enabled"

msgid "Unavailable menu rows"
msgstr "Menu rows ye can't use"

msgid "Greyed: a menu row your selection can't do now, such as First Aid without a medkit, is greyed; Shift-click it to set up the job anyway. Faithful: every row as in the game."
msgstr "Greyed: a menu row yer crew can't do now, such as First Aid without a medkit, be greyed; Shift-click it to set up the job anyway, matey. Faithful: every row as in the game."

