msgid "Take priority:"
msgstr "Plunderin' priority:"

#. machine-translated
msgid "Haulers and workers put things into the storage of the highest put priority first, the nearest among equals. Forbidden: never. Click to raise, Shift+click to lower."
msgstr "Haulers an' deckhands stow loot in the hold o' the highest stowin' priority first, the nearest among equals. Forbidden: never, matey. Click to raise, Shift+click to lower."

#. machine-translated
msgid "Workers and builders take things from the storage of the highest take priority first, the nearest among equals. Forbidden: never. Click to raise, Shift+click to lower."
msgstr "Deckhands an' builders plunder from the hold o' the highest plunderin' priority first, the nearest among equals. Forbidden: never, matey. Click to raise, Shift+click to lower."

